Package: nvu
Version: 1.0.0-2
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Nouveau-Vision
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: bash, python3-minimal, curl, jq, tar, iproute2, systemd, passwd, apt
Description: Nouveau-Vision Unit node and Dashboard installer
 Installs the Nouveau-Vision Unit deployment and management tooling.
 .
 The package provides the nvu command and the frozen B6.2I installer
 payload for NVUN 1.0.0 and Dashboard 1.3.0.
 .
 Installing this package does not deploy a node, create a wallet,
 configure Apache, or request a TLS certificate. Runtime deployment
 is performed separately with the nvu install command.
